# The pin of the git hooks (NUC-hooks-run-nuc §2), read by scripts/check-hooks.sh: the release of
# hivevm/nuc-tools the hooks come from, the blob of each hook as that release's shims/ holds it,
# and each hook/ rule of that release, which nuc.toml turns on. A newer release replaces the hooks
# and this list in one change.
release v0.2.2
